  "description": "In a special forces unit made up of nothing but monsters in human form, Aaron Myer stands out: pretty-faced, sharp-tongued, and quietly harboring a crush on his reliable team leader, Dan Marcus. When Aaron accidentally witnesses Dan being harshly punished by a notorious superior, concern pushes him to visit Dan later that night with a simple excuse. What he finds isn’t the broken man he expected, but something far more...intriguing. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Gunbu Danpyeonseon (군부 단편선) Collection.*",
